{"seq":1,"slug":"webpack-core-concepts","title":"Webpack 核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/webpack-core-concepts","wordCount":637,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"webpack-核心概念\">Webpack 核心概念</h1><h2 id=\"webpack-的设计哲学\">Webpack 的设计哲学</h2><p>Webpack 是前端生态中最具影响力的打包器。它的核心理念是<strong>一切皆模块</strong>——JavaScript、CSS、图片、字体、HTML 模板，所有资源都可以作为模块被引入和处理。这种统一的模块化视角使得 Webpack 能够构建出完整的依赖图，并对所有资源进行统一的优化和输出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Webpack 核心架构&#10;        ENTRY[Entry 入口] --&gt; COMPILER[Compiler 编译器]&#10;        COMPILER --&gt; RESOLVER[Resolver 解析器]&#10;        RESOLVER --&gt; LOADER[Loader 加载器]&#10;        LOADER --&gt; PARSER[Parser 解析器]&#10;        PARSER --&gt; DG[Dependency Graph 依赖图]&#10;        DG --&gt; CHUNK[Chunk 生成]&#10;        CHUNK --&gt; PLUGIN[Plugin 处理]&#10;        PLUGIN --&gt; OUTPUT[Output 输出]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Webpack 核心架构\n        ENTRY[Entry 入口] --&gt; COMPILER[Compiler 编译器]\n        COMPILER --&gt; RESOLVER[Resolver 解析器]\n        RESOLVER --&gt; LOADER[Loader 加载器]\n        LOADER --&gt; PARSER[Parser 解析器]\n        PARSER --&gt; DG[Dependency Graph 依赖图]\n        DG --&gt; CHUNK[Chunk 生成]\n        CHUNK --&gt; PLUGIN[Plugin 处理]\n        PLUGIN --&gt; OUTPUT[Output 输出]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"五大核心概念\">五大核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"entry-入口\">Entry（入口）</h3><p>Entry 是 Webpack 构建依赖图的起点。Webpack 从入口开始，递归地解析所有依赖模块。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// webpack.config.js&#10;&#10;// 单入口&#10;export default {&#10;  entry: &quot;./src/index.ts&quot;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 多入口&#10;export default {&#10;  entry: {&#10;    app: &quot;./src/app.ts&quot;,&#10;    admin: &quot;./src/admin.ts&quot;,&#10;    vendor: [&quot;react&quot;, &quot;react-dom&quot;],&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 动态入口&#10;export default {&#10;  entry: () =&gt; ({&#10;    app: &quot;./src/app.ts&quot;,&#10;    ...(process.env.NODE_ENV === &quot;development&quot;&#10;      ? { devtools: &quot;./src/devtools.ts&quot; }&#10;      : {}),&#10;  }),&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// webpack.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 单入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/index.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 多入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    app: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/app.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    admin: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/admin.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vendor: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"react-dom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 动态入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    app: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/app.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NODE_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"development\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { devtools: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/devtools.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"output-输出\">Output（输出）</h3><p>Output 配置告诉 Webpack 将打包产物写入到哪里，以及如何命名。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"export default {&#10;  output: {&#10;    path: &#39;/dist&#39;,&#10;    filename: &#39;[name].[contenthash:8].js&#39;,&#10;    chunkFilename: &#39;chunks/[name].[contenthash:8].js&#39;,&#10;    publicPath: &#39;/assets/&#39;,&#10;    clean: true,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  output: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/dist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    filename: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[name].[contenthash:8].js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    chunkFilename: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chunks/[name].[contenthash:8].js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    publicPath: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/assets/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    clean: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>占位符</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>[name]</code></td>\n<td>入口名称或 Chunk 名称</td>\n<td>区分多入口产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[contenthash]</code></td>\n<td>基于文件内容的哈希</td>\n<td>长期缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[chunkhash]</code></td>\n<td>基于 Chunk 内容的哈希</td>\n<td>Chunk 级缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[id]</code></td>\n<td>Chunk ID</td>\n<td>调试环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[ext]</code></td>\n<td>文件扩展名</td>\n<td>资源文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"loader-加载器\">Loader（加载器）</h3><p>Loader 是 Webpack 最强大的扩展机制之一。由于 Webpack 原生只理解 JavaScript 和 JSON，所有其他类型的文件都需要通过 Loader 转换为有效的模块。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"export default {&#10;  module: {&#10;    rules: [&#10;      {&#10;        test: /\\.tsx?$/,&#10;        exclude: /node_modules/,&#10;        use: [&#10;          {&#10;            loader: &#39;swc-loader&#39;,&#10;            options: {&#10;              jsc: {&#10;                parser: {&#10;                  syntax: &#39;typescript&#39;,&#10;                  tsx: true,&#10;                },&#10;                transform: {&#10;                  react: {&#10;                    runtime: &#39;automatic&#39;,&#10;                  },&#10;                },&#10;              },&#10;            },&#10;          },&#10;        ],&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        test: /\\.css$/,&#10;        use: [&#39;style-loader&#39;, &#39;css-loader&#39;, &#39;postcss-loader&#39;],&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        test: /\\.svg$/,&#10;        type: &#39;asset&#39;,&#10;        parser: {&#10;          dataUrlCondition: {&#10;            maxSize: 8 * 1024,&#10;          },&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  module: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        test:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">tsx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        exclude:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">node_modules</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        use: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            loader: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'swc-loader'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            options: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              jsc: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                parser: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  syntax: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  tsx: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                transform: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  react: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    runtime: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'automatic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         